WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.787
Once upon a time there lived a very unhappy queen.

2
00:00:09.788 --> 00:00:12.859
She was unhappy because her son was not married.

3
00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.942
Since he was a prince, he could only marry a princess.

4
00:00:15.943 --> 00:00:20.972
It was so hard to find the perfect princess for her son.

5
00:00:20.973 --> 00:00:25.739
Young women from all over the world came to the castle to see if they could marry the prince.

6
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:33.391
The queen wanted to confirm that they were really princesses, so she tested each one.

7
00:00:33.392 --> 00:00:37.283
"What is your name, my dear?" asked the queen.

8
00:00:37.284 --> 00:00:41.997
"I am Princess Valeria of Sweden, Your Highness," answered the princess.

9
00:00:41.998 --> 00:00:46.159
"Let me see your hands, Valeria," said the queen.

10
00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:52.379
"I . . . I beg your pardon?" Valeria said nervously.

11
00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:57.412
"Your hands," the queen repeated. "Just as I thought!

12
00:00:57.413 --> 00:01:00.550
You are not really a princess!

13
00:01:00.551 --> 00:01:04.646
No true princess could have such rough hands!"

14
00:01:04.647 --> 00:01:08.781
The queen dismissed poor Valeria in a huff.

15
00:01:08.782 --> 00:01:12.130
Sometimes the queen inspected the princesses' teeth.

16
00:01:12.131 --> 00:01:16.555
Sometimes she checked their hair. The queen even examined their feet!

17
00:01:16.556 --> 00:01:19.899
Finding the perfect princess was very demanding work.

18
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:24.501
One stormy evening there was an unexpected visitor at the castle.

19
00:01:24.502 --> 00:01:27.043
The prince was the first person to get up.

20
00:01:27.044 --> 00:01:31.552
Outside in the pouring rain stood a beautiful but very wet young lady.

21
00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:35.359
The prince had never seen such a lovely woman before in his life.

22
00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:38.274
"What are you doing in the rain?" the prince asked.

23
00:01:38.275 --> 00:01:43.766
"Well, can I come in or not?" the lady said irritably.

24
00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:46.362
The lady told the prince what had happened.

25
00:01:46.363 --> 00:01:49.608
She had been taking a walk when it began to rain very hard.

26
00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:52.921
She had been walking all night trying to find a dry place.

27
00:01:52.922 --> 00:01:56.568
"May I please stay here tonight?" she asked the prince.

28
00:01:56.569 --> 00:02:00.397
The prince wished she could stay forever.

29
00:02:00.398 --> 00:02:06.171
While the prince and the young lady were talking, the queen silently entered the room.

30
00:02:06.172 --> 00:02:11.008
"What is going on here? Who are you?" demanded the queen.

31
00:02:11.009 --> 00:02:15.829
"Forgive me, Your Highness. I am Princess Winnifred," said the lady.

32
00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.265
"Princess?" asked the queen.

33
00:02:18.266 --> 00:02:21.805
"But my friends call me Winn."

34
00:02:21.806 --> 00:02:24.674
The prince explained to his mother what had happened.

35
00:02:24.675 --> 00:02:27.730
"She must go at once!" shouted the queen.

36
00:02:27.731 --> 00:02:31.428
"Perhaps she really is a princess," the prince said.

37
00:02:31.429 --> 00:02:37.507
"There is only one way to find out." The queen smiled coldly.

38
00:02:37.508 --> 00:02:43.777
"Show me your hands," demanded the queen. "Say ‘Ah,'" said the queen.

39
00:02:43.778 --> 00:02:48.267
Winnifred's teeth were white and hard. The queen pulled on Winn's braid.

40
00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:51.688
Her hair was still wet, but it looked strong and healthy.

41
00:02:51.689 --> 00:02:59.542
"Let me see your feet," the queen said. Her feet were small and straight.

42
00:02:59.543 --> 00:03:03.367
"She may stay the night," the queen agreed.

43
00:03:03.368 --> 00:03:05.875
"See? She was telling the truth.

44
00:03:05.876 --> 00:03:09.756
She really is a princess!" the prince said excitedly.

45
00:03:09.757 --> 00:03:11.431
"Not quite."

46
00:03:11.432 --> 00:03:13.871
"What do you mean?" the prince asked.

47
00:03:13.872 --> 00:03:19.589
"There is one more test," the queen answered.

48
00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:24.744
As the maid prepared the bed, the queen put a tiny pea under the mattress.

49
00:03:24.745 --> 00:03:29.811
Then the servants came in with twenty more mattresses and piled them on top of the first one.

50
00:03:29.812 --> 00:03:39.784
"Only a real princess will be able to feel that little pea under all these mattresses," the queen said happily.

51
00:03:39.785 --> 00:03:42.372
The prince overheard his mother's plan.

52
00:03:42.373 --> 00:03:45.659
He began to worry because he really liked Winn.

53
00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.825
Suddenly he thought of an idea.

54
00:03:47.826 --> 00:03:51.509
The next morning Winnifred came to the dining room for breakfast.

55
00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:55.757
"How did you sleep last night?" asked the queen.

56
00:03:55.758 --> 00:03:59.638
"Oh, I slept wonderfully!" answered Winn.

57
00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:03.317
"You didn't feel uncomfortable at all?" asked the prince.

58
00:04:03.318 --> 00:04:05.742
"Not at all!" Winn answered.

59
00:04:05.743 --> 00:04:11.334
"Well, to tell the truth, it was a bit uncomfortable at first," she added.

60
00:04:11.335 --> 00:04:16.764
"Explain yourself," said the queen.

61
00:04:16.765 --> 00:04:18.976
"I couldn't get comfortable.

62
00:04:18.977 --> 00:04:22.099
It felt like there was something under my mattress.

63
00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.291
I just couldn't get to sleep!

64
00:04:24.292 --> 00:04:30.706
When I looked under the mattress, I found a pair of scissors, three books, and a toy bicycle!"

65
00:04:30.707 --> 00:04:37.388
The prince had put all these things there to make sure that she looked under her mattress.

66
00:04:37.389 --> 00:04:46.611
"After you removed all those items from under your mattress, I'm sure you were able to fall asleep comfortably," said the queen.

67
00:04:46.612 --> 00:04:50.278
"Well, not exactly," said Winn.

68
00:04:50.279 --> 00:04:53.215
"There was still something under my mattress!

69
00:04:53.216 --> 00:04:58.313
Finally I found what was making me uncomfortable!"

70
00:04:58.314 --> 00:05:01.267
Winn showed the queen and the prince the pea.

71
00:05:01.268 --> 00:05:05.733
"You truly are a princess," said the queen.

72
00:05:05.734 --> 00:05:10.798
"Of course I am," said Winn. "Can you pass me the eggs please?"

73
00:05:10.799 --> 00:05:15.750
The queen was very happy now. Princess Winnifred and her son were married.

74
00:05:15.751 --> 00:05:23.151
And they lived happily ever after.
